From a1068a5cfb902b4e5d812082c17eb61bba6f5a9b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FiyeroT <me@fiyero.xyz>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 16:52:29 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 168/171] rule-set updater: big lists one at a time

An update of a list holds its download, builds the next list beside the one
in use and saves it; five big lists due together took all of that at once.
A rule set whose content is 1 MiB or more now waits for the update of any
other such one; small lists and those that hold nothing yet go together as
before, small ones first.
---
 route/rule/rule_set_remote.go       |  3 ++
 route/rule/rule_set_updater.go      | 33 ++++++++++++++++--
 route/rule/rule_set_updater_test.go | 53 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 87 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/route/rule/rule_set_remote.go b/route/rule/rule_set_remote.go
